WEBVTT

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:24.416
MISSION 8: TWO HEROES

00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:13.500
Little doggy, what nice fur you have.

00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:16.416
It'll make me a nice cloak.

00:02:51.541 --> 00:02:54.041
I've been waiting for you,
Iron-handed Dragon King.

00:02:55.333 --> 00:02:57.375
I'm not here to be bothered by small talk,

00:02:57.458 --> 00:02:59.500
let alone have you stain
my brand new cloak.

00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:02.750
I'm only here to convey you a message.

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:04.458
What is it?

00:03:06.166 --> 00:03:07.333
You're going to die.

00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:25.708
Who the hell are...

00:03:36.291 --> 00:03:38.166
IRON HAND CLAN, FLYING BIRD CLAN,
SKY WOLF CLAN, POISON DRAGON CLAN

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.875
-Let's go.
-Yes, Master.

00:04:05.416 --> 00:04:07.125
You're not my disciple yet.

00:04:07.291 --> 00:04:08.750
Not until I kill them all.

00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:10.333
That is if you survive until then.

00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:52.916
Master, why did we stop?

00:04:53.125 --> 00:04:54.291
I'm waiting for someone.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.791
I am the emissary of the Shadow Killers.

00:05:39.583 --> 00:05:41.166
My chief would like to see you.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.208
GREEN PHOENIX BECAME
A SHADOW KILLER AT AGE 21.

00:05:47.541 --> 00:05:48.875
THE NEXT YEAR,

00:05:49.291 --> 00:05:52.416
THE LEADER BROUGHT IN A 15-YEAR-OLD BOY.

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.666
Starting today,

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.083
you are one of
the Seven Great Shadow Killers.

00:06:37.375 --> 00:06:39.666
Your code name is Seven.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.875
You've never taken on a mission,

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.750
yet you've been appointed
as a Shadow Killer just like that.

00:07:31.458 --> 00:07:35.125
You're exactly just like us,
having a zero head count.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.666
Show me what you've got.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.750
Let's see how terrific you truly are.

00:07:46.791 --> 00:07:48.041
No, thank you.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.291
I don't kill anyone outside my mission.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.958
<i>I can't tell what clan he came from</i>
<i>by looking at his moves,</i>

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.583
<i>but he reacts just as nimbly</i>
<i>as a wild beast.</i>

00:09:25.166 --> 00:09:27.333
<i>The moment his teeth penetrated my skin,</i>

00:09:27.458 --> 00:09:29.291
<i>I felt as if my energy was sapped away.</i>

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.166
<i>I must not let him bite me again.</i>

00:09:33.041 --> 00:09:35.833
<i>This boy reacted so swiftly,</i>
<i>it's astonishing.</i>

00:09:35.916 --> 00:09:39.250
<i>He could sense and break free from</i>
<i>Redtooth's trap at that very moment.</i>

00:09:40.208 --> 00:09:43.250
<i>If it were me,</i>
<i>I'm not sure if I could manage that.</i>

00:10:44.375 --> 00:10:48.625
You should know that infighting
is not tolerated among the league.

00:11:02.458 --> 00:11:05.083
I'm just teasing the newbie.

00:11:05.166 --> 00:11:08.083
Welcome to the Shadow Killers club.

00:11:08.791 --> 00:11:11.458
Let's pray that
you'll live a little longer

00:11:12.041 --> 00:11:14.625
so we can play together with pleasure.

00:11:24.333 --> 00:11:26.958
If you had a good sword, you would've won.

00:11:27.708 --> 00:11:29.875
What's the best sword in the world?

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.416
Do you fear death?

00:11:33.833 --> 00:11:34.791
What do you think?

00:11:35.291 --> 00:11:39.291
The one and only,
attack-only Thousand Demon Daggers.

00:11:40.875 --> 00:11:41.958
Where is it?

00:11:42.708 --> 00:11:46.750
It's a national treasure of Shenduan,
guarded by the Millenium Dark Spirit.

00:13:47.208 --> 00:13:49.208
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
